          "text": "UFaro Nego wabeka u-Eliyakimi, indodana kaJosiya, inkosi esikhundleni sikaJosiya uyise, waliguqula igama lakhe laba nguJoyakimi, wamsusa uJowahasi; wafika eGibithe, wafela khona.",
