          "text": "UJehoyakimi wanika uFaro isiliva negolide; kepha wathelisa izwe ukuba akhiphe imali ngokomthetho kaFaro; wabiza isiliva negolide kubantu bezwe, kwaba yilowo nalowo ngokwentela yakhe, ukuba alinike uFaro Nego.",
